# Where the Space keeps its files when it is run from a checkout rather than on the
# platform (hf_space/session.py:data_root, used when no bucket is mounted and
# OASIS_SPACE_DATA is unset). Uploads, results and config land here.
#
# Scoped to this directory rather than added to the repo-root .gitignore so that adding the
# Space does not modify a tracked file.
.local-data/
